SPRING BOOT ACTUATOR ENDPOINTS
=============================

Base Endpoint
-------------
GET  /actuator
-> Lists all exposed actuator endpoints.

Health & Monitoring
-------------------
GET  /actuator/health
-> Application health status (UP/DOWN).

GET  /actuator/health/liveness
-> Checks if application is alive.

GET  /actuator/health/readiness
-> Checks if application is ready to serve requests.

Application Info
----------------
GET  /actuator/info
-> Custom application information.

Metrics
-------
GET  /actuator/metrics
-> List all available metrics.

GET  /actuator/metrics/jvm.memory.used
-> JVM memory usage.

GET  /actuator/metrics/system.cpu.usage
-> CPU usage.

GET  /actuator/metrics/http.server.requests
-> HTTP request statistics.

Spring Context
--------------
GET  /actuator/beans
-> All Spring beans.

GET  /actuator/configprops
-> Configuration properties.

GET  /actuator/env
-> Environment properties.

GET  /actuator/env/server.port
-> Specific property value.

Request Mapping
---------------
GET  /actuator/mappings
-> Lists all API mappings.

Logging
-------
GET  /actuator/loggers
-> Available loggers.

GET  /actuator/loggers/{logger-name}
-> Details of specific logger.

Thread & Memory
---------------
GET  /actuator/threaddump
-> JVM thread dump.

GET  /actuator/heapdump
-> JVM heap dump.

Tasks & Cache
-------------
GET  /actuator/scheduledtasks
-> Scheduled jobs.

GET  /actuator/caches
-> Cache information.

HTTP Requests
-------------
GET  /actuator/httpexchanges
-> Recent HTTP requests.

Startup Details
---------------
GET  /actuator/startup
-> Application startup steps.

Prometheus
----------
GET  /actuator/prometheus
-> Metrics for Prometheus monitoring.

Shutdown
--------
POST /actuator/shutdown
-> Gracefully stops application.
   (Disabled by default)

